      "content": "The pressure to \"create meaning\" can indeed feel like a heavy and desperate self-imposition, which is why it is such a difficult thought to carry. It is okay to feel that the struggle to find purpose is just a heavy burden, and you do not need to force a cure to existential dread.\n\nPlease allow yourself the space to feel that exhaustion and the pain of the situation without the immediate need to \"fix\" it or \"re-purpose\" it right now.\n\nIf these feelings of despair become overwhelming, please remember that immediate support is available 24/7, and you can call or text 988 in the US and Canada to talk to someone right away.",
